### ============================================================================
### WEBHOOK ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Webhooks para notificaciones de pagos y eventos externos

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1

### ============================================================================
### 1. POST /payments/webhook - Payment Confirmation Webhook
### ============================================================================
### Webhook que recibe confirmaciones de pago de proveedores externos
### Nota: Este endpoint debería estar protegido con HMAC o API key

POST {{@api}}/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "payment.confirmed",
  "paymentId": "pay_12345",
  "transactionId": "tx_12345",
  "status": "completed",
  "amount": 100,
  "walletAddress": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "metadata": {
    "provider": "stripe",
    "timestamp": "2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"
  }
}

### Response should be 200 OK with acknowledgment


